requirements fees v1
description "What a refund costs: written for the tests of yuen affected, which follow a contribution to the rule it adds to and back"

role finance "Decides what a refund costs"

requirement fee_by_way
  text "A refund by post costs 5, and one at the counter costs nothing"
  owner finance
  decided 2026-11-02 by finance "Written for this test"
